# Ed25519 public keys trusted to sign OPNsense agent releases (one base64 key per line).
#
# A manager stages an agent package only if its release record is signed by one
# of these keys (scripts/stage_agent_package.php, inc/agent_package.php). The
# matching secret is the repository secret OPNMGR_AGENT_RELEASE_KEY, used by
# .github/workflows/release.yml. It is never committed.
#
# Forks that publish their own releases add their key here, or set
# OPNMGR_AGENT_RELEASE_PUBKEYS in .env without editing this file.
